254-## 3. Control-Packet Mapping
255-
256-When the task needs structure, prefer a compact packet over a heavy report.
257-
258-Useful packet families:
259-
260-- coding kickoff or bounded patch scope -> `Coding-agent invocation pack`
261-- route choice under budget or risk -> `Resource budget and route-choice memo`
262-- next step ranking -> `Prioritization queue / next-action memo`
263-- multi-round discovery -> `Exploration frontier / hypothesis memo`
264-- capability contract or precondition boundary -> `Tool capability contract / precondition memo`
265-- substrate quality or autonomy-fit review -> `Operational substrate readiness memo`
266-- retrieval boundary or mode escalation -> `Evidence target / retrieval-mode memo`
267-- post-retrieval consulted-source transparency -> `Source consultation ledger`
268-- memory typing or checkpoint packaging -> `Memory scope / checkpoint profile memo`
269-- long-running progress control -> `Goal-monitoring status memo`
270-- blocked state or controlled fallback -> `Recovery / escalation checkpoint memo`
271-- coordination topology choice -> `Orchestration topology decision memo`
272-- capability identity or trust-boundary handoff -> `Agent card / capability manifest`
273-- long-running async state tracking -> `Async lifecycle status memo`
274-- ordered lifecycle transitions or traceable partial-state history -> `Lifecycle event / audit trail memo`
275-- future-behavior change decision -> `Adaptation decision memo`
276-- reusable signal-strength review -> `Learning-signal review memo`
277-- mid-execution quality gate -> `Quality iteration checkpoint memo`
278-- approval-sensitive execution -> `HITL approval packet` or `Plan approval checkpoint artifact`
279-- MCP reuse or operator handoff -> `MCP capability handoff memo`
280-- A2A lifecycle-aware collaboration -> `A2A task-handoff memo`
281-- process-quality or replay-safe inspection -> `Safe trajectory artifact report`
282-- tool regression or deterministic harness evaluation -> `Mock-tool evaluation report`
283-- bounded multi-view challenge -> `Debate / consensus comparison memo`
284-- prompt-stack rewrite or release audit -> `Prompt-stack release review`
285:- guide-chapter reflection or doc-to-runtime parity benchmark -> `Guide reflection benchmark memo`
286-- assembled prompt replay setup -> `Benchmark cohort manifest`
287-- assembled prompt replay runner-state verdict -> `Replay runner verdict sheet`
288-- assembled prompt replay suite summary -> `Replay suite verdict memo`
289-- governance-owned packet-floor audit or omission-sensitive review -> `Packet compliance report`
290:- versioned replay suite or benchmark cohort definition -> `Benchmark registry memo`
291-- context-pack sufficiency or stale-context review -> `Context sufficiency review memo`
292-- critique-loop quality or no-gain-loop review -> `Critique quality review memo`
293-- adaptation promotion or rollback gate -> `Adaptation promotion review memo`
294-- route, prioritization, or exploration scoring -> `Route-quality scorecard`
295:- repo-scale coding scenario and verification-running contract -> `Coding benchmark scenario memo`
296:- executed benchmark result or cohort verdict -> `Benchmark execution report`
297-- replay execution verdict -> `Replay suite verdict memo`
