182:- if the active path fails the progress check, narrow, recover, or replan
189:- preserve one cheaper fallback route and one stronger route trigger when budget, tool tier, or route strength could change materially
235:Use chaining and routing only when they materially improve execution quality.
238:Use a short staged path when:
243:Do not chain when:
