6433-## 15. Generalization Rule
6434-
6435-### 15.1 Allowed generalization
6436-
6437-- preserve section names or lightly compress them
6438-- replace placeholders with current task/user context
6439-- adjust density within the same task family
6440-- specialize verification wording within the same verification pattern
6441:- reuse family-level structure for advanced prompting, multimodal, workflow, or evaluation artifacts without reusing content
6442-
6443-### 15.2 Not allowed
6444-
6445-- reusing factual content from an example body
6446-- transplanting domain facts from an example directly into the current task
6447-- adding selection rules that do not exist in the entry body
6448-- embedding cross-entry priority or scoring logic
6449-- converting a structure exemplar into runtime policy
